      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "One step back in time",
      "texto": "A statement becomes **dijo que**. A yes/no question becomes **preguntó si**.\n\nIf the original was present, the report often moves to the imperfect.\n\n- «Estoy cansada.» → Ana **dijo que estaba** cansada.\n- «¿Hablas español?» → Me **preguntó si hablaba** español.\n\n**Dice que está cansada** stays in the present when the report is still current."
